This project is a Rust port of the CP-SAT solver from Google OR-Tools
(https://github.com/google/or-tools), at commit
c931f5f778c88050a3f71d72dfc30d3d020aa821.

The original code is Copyright Google LLC and is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.

Changes: the code is translated from C++ to Rust. Each ported file keeps the
upstream Apache 2.0 header and a line that names the upstream file, the
upstream commit and the change.

crates/base/src/hash.rs holds a Rust translation of fast-hash
(https://github.com/ztanml/fast-hash), which OR-Tools copies in
ortools/base/hash.cc. fast-hash carries this notice:

